============================================================

For URL and request modes:

- Use a mature HTTP client library
- Support GET, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE, HEAD, and OPTIONS
- Support custom headers
- Support request body
- Support cookies
- Support redirects
- Support proxies
- Support TLS verification control
- Support timeout
